      "start": 3.348,
      "end": 8.985,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakt",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Al-Roshd, you take it and spread it out all over the place.",
      "start": 8.985,
      "end": 13.012,
      "speaker": "Isamil Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Rashad jan, (unintelligible) Ismail Barakat: He won't let me speak.",
      "start": 13.012,
      "end": 15.012,
      "speaker": "Behrouz",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes. 218. Page 218.",
      "start": 15.681,
      "end": 19.258,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "How about 228? Let's make it a complete set of numbers. Dr. Khalifa: Then, open it at random.",
      "start": 20.671,
      "end": 25.768,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "This is right?",
      "start": 30.621,
      "end": 31.853,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "You read...",
      "start": 33.45,
      "end": 34.836,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "He's a member of the Quranic study, Fajr Quranic study group.",
      "start": 36.399,
      "end": 39.991,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Look.",
      "start": 40.79,
      "end": 41.29,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Then, worries.",
      "start": 41.29,
      "end": 42.123,
      "speaker": "A man",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "He laughs.",
      "start": 43.29,
      "end": 43.938,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "(unintelligible) laughing",
      "start": 43.938,
      "end": 45.0,
      "speaker": "Emily",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "And he just sits there and reads, yeah?",
      "start": 45.658,
      "end": 47.167,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes. He follows us. He asks questions sometimes.",
      "start": 47.167,
      "end": 50.189,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Like \"where is my breakfast?\"",
      "start": 52.751,
      "end": 54.348,
      "speaker": "Emily",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "(unintelligible)",
      "start": 54.348,
      "end": 55.795,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "I think the person who's answering, Emily, she understands his language.",
      "start": 56.682,
      "end": 60.676,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, she speaks cattish.",
      "start": 60.676,
      "end": 62.676,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "(unintelligible) that.",
      "start": 62.983,
      "end": 64.185,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "You know, Ismail lowered his volume, his voice, yesterday. But still,",
      "start": 65.161,
      "end": 68.93299999999999,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Behrouz woke up and came here to say \"what's happened?\"",
      "start": 68.93299999999999,
      "end": 71.24,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "5 minutes after Ismail arrived, Behrouz comes.",
      "start": 74.155,
      "end": 76.983,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "There was somebody in there, but I thought it was him, I thought maybe this was a fight about something.",
      "start": 76.983,
      "end": 81.161,
      "speaker": "Emily",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "And that was when you were in your apartment, right?",
      "start": 81.161,
      "end": 82.882,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "No.",
      "start": 82.882,
      "end": 83.382,
      "speaker": "Emily",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "No?!",
      "start": 83.382,
      "end": 84.215,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "No, I was talking to (unintelligible).",
      "start": 84.82900000000001,
      "end": 86.89099999999999,
      "speaker": "Emily",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Right. You see, I shouted from the other end when, then you got the message on your recording.",
      "start": 86.89099999999999,
      "end": 90.938,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "You know, in Iran, the first commandment is that you must be in a state of grief",
      "start": 92.412,
      "end": 96.018,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, I know.",
      "start": 96.018,
      "end": 96.851,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "continuously, and Behrouz recording our meetings, so far, there's nothing but laughing.",
      "start": 96.851,
      "end": 101.186,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Alhamdu Lillah",
      "start": 103.186,
      "end": 104.142,
      "speaker": "Behrouz",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "About the cats.",
      "start": 104.142,
      "end": 105.186,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "What do they do when they meet each other? Dr. Khalifa: (unintelligible)",
      "start": 105.616,
      "end": 107.52600000000001,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The first thing \"Ah, it's nice to meet you.\" [mocking cry]",
      "start": 107.52600000000001,
      "end": 111.799,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Oh great.\" [mocking cry]",
      "start": 114.441,
      "end": 116.441,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah. You didn't hear, you didn’t hear about the Ayatollah. What Ayatollah does. Dr. Khalifa: Right.",
      "start": 117.11,
      "end": 120.252,
      "speaker": "Mahmood Abib",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "They...",
      "start": 120.252,
      "end": 120.866,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Behrouz will tell you.",
      "start": 120.866,
      "end": 121.822,
      "speaker": "Mahmood Abib",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, yes, that, that was funny.",
      "start": 121.822,
      "end": 123.822,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Bet you're gonna see this. Khomeini, Khomeini is always serious in public and the people (unintelligible). When he goes to room, what does he do?",
      "start": 124.737,
      "end": 131.029,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "He breaks out.",
      "start": 132.135,
      "end": 133.336,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "But he always used to sit up there and go like this, yeah go like that and then as soon as he goes to his room, he goes...",
      "start": 133.732,
      "end": 140.647,
      "speaker": "Behrouz",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Because he kept telling me \"come over, come over\", and I say, \"well, you know, I'm too busy. I'm (unintelligible)\"",
      "start": 140.647,
      "end": 145.835,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "So, he only, the only reason he came in because I told him \"suppose you have a heart attack and die",
      "start": 145.835,
      "end": 149.56,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "\"right now, who's gonna take care of the office?\"",
      "start": 149.56,
      "end": 151.737,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "He said \"yeah, you're right.\" I said \"OK, consider yourself dead.\" And then he's coming here. I mean, this is...",
      "start": 152.106,
      "end": 157.546,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "In fact, that's what I told Carl. I told him \"if anybody asks, say \"he kicked the bucket.\"",
      "start": 157.546,
      "end": 162.059,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "He's right.",
      "start": 162.059,
      "end": 162.91899999999998,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "He died. I don’t know when he's coming back.",
      "start": 163.165,
      "end": 165.872,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakt",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "أعوذ بِٱللَّهِ مِنَ ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنِ ٱلرَّجِيمِ",
      "start": 166.24099999999999,
      "end": 168.403,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Bism Allah Arrahman Arraheem",
      "start": 168.894,
      "end": 170.71,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The Truth Prevails",
      "start": 171.598,
      "end": 173.503,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "[10:79]  Pharaoh said, \"Bring to me every experienced magician.\"",
      "start": 173.994,
      "end": 178.39,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "[10:80]  When the magicians came, Moses said to them, \"Throw whatever you are going to throw.\"",
      "start": 178.786,
      "end": 184.15,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "[10:81]  When they threw, Moses said, \"What you have just produced is magic, GOD will nullify it. GOD does not support the transgressors' work.\"",
      "start": 184.15,
      "end": 193.529,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "[10:82]  GOD establishes the truth with His words, despite the criminals.",
      "start": 193.529,
      "end": 197.558,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "[10:83]  The only ones who believed with Moses were a few of his people, in spite of fearing the tyranny of Pharaoh and his elders. Surely, Pharaoh was much too arrogant on earth, a real tyrant.",
      "start": 198.29500000000002,
      "end": 210.0,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "[10:84]  Moses said, \"O my people, if you have really believed in GOD, then put your trust in Him, if you are Muslims.\"",
      "start": 210.0,
      "end": 217.188,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "[10:85]  They said, \"We trust in GOD. Our Lord, save us from the persecution of these unjust people.",
      "start": 217.188,
      "end": 223.412,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "[10:86]  \"Deliver us, with Your mercy, from the disbelieving people.\"",
      "start": 223.412,
      "end": 227.851,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "[10:87]  We inspired Moses and his brother. \"Maintain your homes in Egypt for the time being, turn your homes into sanctuaries, and observe the Contact Prayers (Salat). Give good news to the believers.\"",
      "start": 227.851,
      "end": 240.545,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "[10:88]  Moses said, \"Our Lord, You have given Pharaoh and his elders luxuries and wealth in this world. ...",
      "start": 242.142,
      "end": 249.449,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "[10:88] ... Our Lord, [the Saudis] only use them to repulse others from Your path. Our Lord, wipe out their wealth, and harden their hearts to prevent them from believing, until they see the painful retribution.\"",
      "start": 249.449,
      "end": 263.183,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "By the way, Muhammad Bin Jafar did some investigations on Eric and they found the telephone number that he had in his briefcase",
      "start": 263.887,
      "end": 271.4,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "was the Saudi embassy in Paris.",
      "start": 271.4,
      "end": 273.27,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Wow",
      "start": 273.7,
      "end": 274.533,
      "speaker": "Behrouz",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yep. Just like we suspected. I should've called Ihsan. I will, definitely.",
      "start": 274.533,
      "end": 279.543,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "He just sent me a letter very nice. Will he, will he be very nice to a person who kicked him out, in that way? So, they spy.",
      "start": 281.44100000000003,
      "end": 292.154,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "89",
      "start": 292.584,
      "end": 293.424,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, he missed the million dollars.",
      "start": 293.424,
      "end": 295.424,
      "speaker": "Behrouz",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "start": 296.345,
      "end": 296.914,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "start": 296.914,
      "end": 297.591,
      "speaker": "A man",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "So, all the signs were that, that, that of a spy because he always complained about business is bad,",
      "start": 298.328,
      "end": 304.422,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "he's running out of money, he's very poor, he sleeps in a small room with a tiny bed, and things like that, then he flies to Switzerland.",
      "start": 304.422,
      "end": 311.583,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "start": 311.583,
      "end": 312.47,
      "speaker": "A woman",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "He must be an accountant. Dr. Khalifa: (unintelligible) Yes.",
      "start": 312.47,
      "end": 314.405,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "an accountant.",
      "start": 316.616,
      "end": 318.125,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, at first glance, he had a small room.",
      "start": 318.125,
      "end": 320.644,
      "speaker": "Behrouz",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, because the Saudis not only pay for his flights, that's what they do. Too much money. 89.",
      "start": 321.532,
      "end": 329.566,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "[10:89]  God said, \"Your prayer has been answered (O Moses and Aaron), ...",
      "start": 330.487,
      "end": 337.17,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "This means \"your\" is directed to two people.",
      "start": 337.17,
      "end": 339.969,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "[10:89]  ... so be steadfast, and do not follow the ways of those who do not know.\"",
      "start": 340.365,
      "end": 344.508,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "[10:90]  We delivered the Children of Israel across the sea. Pharaoh and his troops pursued them, aggressively and sinfully. ...",
      "start": 344.508,
      "end": 351.646,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "[10:90]  ... When drowning became a reality for him, he said, \"I believe that there is no god except the One in whom the Children of Israel have believed; I am a Muslim.\"",
      "start": 351.646,
      "end": 361.755,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "[10:91]  \"Too late! For you have rebelled in the past. You have been wicked.",
      "start": 362.151,
      "end": 366.982,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "[10:92]  \"Today, we will preserve your body, to set you up as a lesson for future generations.\" Yet, many people are totally heedless to our signs.",
      "start": 366.982,
      "end": 378.778,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Some important lessons you learn from here, first of all, imagine yourself",
      "start": 380.682,
      "end": 385.86,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "your self, you, running away and somebody was running after you. And then, you hit shore of the ocean,",
      "start": 385.86,
      "end": 394.379,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "but God is with you. So, what will happen?",
      "start": 394.379,
      "end": 397.303,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "God will send a helicopter or something.",
      "start": 399.303,
      "end": 401.303,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "This is what happened to the Children of Israel. They're weak. An army of Pharaoh is following them and they hit",
      "start": 402.709,
      "end": 409.40999999999997,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "this, the Red Sea, but God delivered them across the Red Sea. This shows you God's time. Some smart-alecky, he's a geologist,",
      "start": 409.40999999999997,
      "end": 418.83,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "explained that this is possible, geologically, because the rocks will move this way and this way and the water will part.",
      "start": 418.83,
      "end": 425.317,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "(unintelligible)",
      "start": 425.317,
      "end": 426.58,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "You'll have...",
      "start": 427.467,
      "end": 428.532,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "You'll have dry land between the waters,",
      "start": 431.542,
      "end": 435.597,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "but he forgot a minor detail. Why did this happen when Moses and his people",
      "start": 435.597,
      "end": 439.334,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "were standing right there? Ismail Barakat: at that, at that specific instance?",
      "start": 439.334,
      "end": 441.58,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, right.",
      "start": 441.58,
      "end": 442.904,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "(unintelligible)",
      "start": 443.395,
      "end": 444.658,
      "speaker": "A woman",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "And it might take years for the rocks to do what he's talking about.",
      "start": 445.048,
      "end": 448.806,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "start": 448.806,
      "end": 449.306,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "(unintelligible)",
      "start": 449.306,
      "end": 450.903,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "And how come it didn't happen again?",
      "start": 450.903,
      "end": 452.596,
      "speaker": "Mahmood Abib",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Right. Why, why on that, that moment?",
      "start": 452.842,
      "end": 454.842,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The shape of...",
      "start": 455.825,
      "end": 456.363,
      "speaker": "A man",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Best of timing. Yes. Even that is great.",
      "start": 456.363,
      "end": 459.922,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "We used listen to Rock and Roll music (unintelligible)",
      "start": 459.922,
      "end": 463.424,
      "speaker": "Behrouz",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Really. So, this tells you and me, I mean, if we are",
      "start": 463.424,
      "end": 469.26,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "believers, we must trust in God that there is no obstacle or problem. Sura 72",
      "start": 469.26,
      "end": 476.264,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "فَمَن يُؤْمِنۢ بِرَبِّهِۦ فَلَا يَخَافُ بَخْسًۭا وَلَا رَهَقًۭا (72:13)",
      "start": 476.264,
      "end": 479.274,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Those who believe in their Lord shall fear no injustice and no suffering. None.",
      "start": 479.274,
      "end": 488.398,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "We must have confidence... we read before yesterday, or the day before",
      "start": 488.398,
      "end": 491.734,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "how God told Moses mother, if you're afraid, throw him in the river.",
      "start": 491.734,
      "end": 495.912,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I know. It takes, it takes YA'NI (meaning),",
      "start": 495.912,
      "end": 500.352,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "put yourself",
      "start": 500.352,
      "end": 501.676,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "in that position where you are told \"you have faith.\" And you're told to throw your baby in the water.",
      "start": 501.676,
      "end": 510.25,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "start": 510.25,
      "end": 511.103,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Subhan Allah. She must have... but Allah Subhanahu Wa Ta'ala says that He strengthened her heart.",
      "start": 512.147,
      "end": 517.046,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "That was later, you see, because she did also (unintelligible)",
      "start": 517.906,
      "end": 520.317,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yep. Because, for me, I would say \"hold it.\"",
      "start": 520.317,
      "end": 523.758,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Hey, wait a minute.\"",
      "start": 524.065,
      "end": 525.0,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Anybody else up there?\"",
      "start": 526.618,
      "end": 528.004,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Astaghfirullah. I hope this never happens to me. You say, you say things, like, you have to get tested.",
      "start": 532.98,
      "end": 538.072,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, well, you already gave yourself a test.",
      "start": 538.072,
      "end": 540.0,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Huh?",
      "start": 540.0,
      "end": 540.635,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "You already gave yourself a test. Ismail Barakat: Astaghfirullah.",
      "start": 540.635,
      "end": 542.478,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "start": 542.478,
      "end": 543.304,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "I have to go through that?",
      "start": 543.304,
      "end": 545.086,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "You have to repent. No, you already did it. And you flunked. You said \"if it were me...\"",
      "start": 545.086,
      "end": 550.861,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, I, I have told all the",
      "start": 550.861,
      "end": 553.711,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "folks here not to even answer a question like that. Don't put yourself in those positions. Ismail Barakat: I know, I know, I know, I know, I know, I know, I know,",
      "start": 553.711,
      "end": 559.302,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "So, this is why I've...",
      "start": 559.302,
      "end": 560.56,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "This is why you're in Tucson.",
      "start": 560.56,
      "end": 561.516,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "How do we, how do we think this back?",
      "start": 561.516,
      "end": 564.13,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Cause the angel's here.",
      "start": 564.13,
      "end": 565.147,
      "speaker": "Mahmood Abib",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "We repent. We say...",
      "start": 565.7,
      "end": 566.963,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Astaghfirullah.",
      "start": 566.963,
      "end": 567.796,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah. Ismail Barakat: Yeah.",
      "start": 567.796,
      "end": 568.977,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The angel is here, you know. Take it seriously.",
      "start": 568.977,
      "end": 571.407,
      "speaker": "Mahmood Abib",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Cause Satan tried to mimic God's voice, like he did it to Abraham, and tell you to go to the highest building in Vancouver and jump.",
      "start": 577.038,
      "end": 584.149,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, but if He says that, I'll tell Him \"no.\"",
      "start": 584.149,
      "end": 586.203,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm just telling you. God is saying that.",
      "start": 590.381,
      "end": 592.259,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "I still tell Him \"no.\" Because God will not, God, God will not order me to do...",
      "start": 592.259,
      "end": 597.515,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly. Because of the law. God says",
      "start": 597.945,
      "end": 599.945,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "God does not advocate...",
      "start": 600.0,
      "end": 601.743,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Al-Fahsha (ٱلْفَحْشَآءِ)",
      "start": 601.743,
      "end": 602.33,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَا يَأْمُرُ بِٱلْفَحْشَآءِ (7:28)",
      "start": 602.33,
      "end": 604.944,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "God does not advocate things like that.",
      "start": 604.944,
      "end": 607.497,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Say, get away you, Satan you.",
      "start": 609.177,
      "end": 611.152,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Actually, it was a test for Moses' mother, too.",
      "start": 611.459,
      "end": 615.0,
      "speaker": "Behrouz",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, of course.",
      "start": 615.307,
      "end": 618.761,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "She was a believer, as stated in the Quran. The other lesson is...",
      "start": 618.761,
      "end": 623.033,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Hold on Al-Roshd. Allah Subhanahu Wa Ta'ala didn't just tell her to dump him in the river.",
      "start": 623.77,
      "end": 628.449,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "start": 628.449,
      "end": 629.432,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "He said...",
      "start": 629.432,
      "end": 630.449,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "We will make him a messenger.",
      "start": 630.879,
      "end": 631.767,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "لَا تَخَافِى وَلَا تَحْزَنِىٓ ۖ إِنَّا رَآدُّوهُ إِلَيْكِ وَجَاعِلُوهُ مِنَ ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ (28:7)",
      "start": 631.767,
      "end": 637.05,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "start": 637.05,
      "end": 637.726,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Hey, you're memorizing the Quran now.",
      "start": 637.726,
      "end": 640.501,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Wallahi, I'm not memorizing, just this one.",
      "start": 640.501,
      "end": 642.297,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Right. This is what I'm saying.",
      "start": 642.297,
      "end": 643.314,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "This is what I'm saying.",
      "start": 645.0,
      "end": 646.229,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "When I met this guy, he didn't know a letter from the Quran. Ismail Barakat: So, (unintelligible) I think...",
      "start": 646.843,
      "end": 649.44,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "I think that's what I said. Yeah.",
      "start": 649.44,
      "end": 651.194,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "She got, she got a lot of...",
      "start": 652.436,
      "end": 653.85,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "I should have, I should have recorded you before and after. Even his Arabic was broken, you know.",
      "start": 653.85,
      "end": 660.396,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "It's recorded.",
      "start": 660.977,
      "end": 661.825,
      "speaker": "Mahmood Abib",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes. That's right.",
      "start": 662.132,
      "end": 665.054,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The second great lesson that we learn from here is that Pharaoh died a believer. He really was a believer,",
      "start": 665.769,
      "end": 675.0,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "but he didn’t have time to develop his soul. This is why 91 says",
      "start": 675.0,
      "end": 679.607,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "[10:91]  \"Too late!* ...",
      "start": 680.098,
      "end": 681.238,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "This is very important and this is consistent in the Quran. It says, on the Day of Judgement, it will not benefit",
      "start": 683.109,
      "end": 688.79,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "any believing soul its belief if it did not gain  from its belief by developing the soul.",
      "start": 688.79,
      "end": 697.467,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "لَمْ تَكُنْ ءَامَنَتْ ... أَوْ كَسَبَتْ فِىٓ إِيمَـٰنِهَا خَيْرًۭا (6:158)",
      "start": 698.081,
      "end": 701.144,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "In a soul that did not believe and earn from the belief, this growth and development which is",
      "start": 701.144,
      "end": 707.2909999999999,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "the 5 prayers, the fasting of Ramadan, commemorating God most of the day, etc. etc.",
      "start": 707.2909999999999,
      "end": 714.574,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "If, if he would have, I mean, died...",
      "start": 715.83,
      "end": 719.016,
      "speaker": "Behrouz",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "start": 719.016,
      "end": 720.0,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes. Behrouz: And",
      "start": 720.0,
      "end": 720.919,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "astray again.",
      "start": 720.919,
      "end": 722.919,
      "speaker": "Behrouz",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "No.",
      "start": 723.472,
      "end": 724.059,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "If he wouldn't die... Dr. Khalifa: No.",
      "start": 724.059,
      "end": 725.26,
      "speaker": "Behrouz",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "No.",
      "start": 725.26,
      "end": 726.093,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Cause he was supposed to die right there.",
      "start": 726.892,
      "end": 728.216,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "start": 728.216,
      "end": 729.215,
      "speaker": "Behrouz",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "But no, but he really believed. He really believed.",
      "start": 729.215,
      "end": 731.938,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, with this kind of evidence who wouldn't believe, of course.",
      "start": 733.044,
      "end": 735.676,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, really, I mean, he's dying.",
      "start": 736.598,
      "end": 738.291,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Even Rasool would.",
      "start": 738.967,
      "end": 740.182,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah. It's too late.",
      "start": 740.182,
      "end": 743.104,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "In fact, this is what they all say at the time of death \"just send me back. I'll do better.\" But this is after the angles beat them up,",
      "start": 743.104,
      "end": 750.307,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "you know, and they discover they were wrong.",
      "start": 750.307,
      "end": 752.123,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "However, Pharaoh said it.",
      "start": 752.799,
      "end": 754.028,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "(unintelligible)",
      "start": 754.028,
      "end": 756.028,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, because the angels got him.",
      "start": 756.028,
      "end": 758.704,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "When, when drowning became imminent.",
      "start": 759.987,
      "end": 762.909,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "And the third big lesson is in 92 that tells us that God's miracle of preserving",
      "start": 766.902,
      "end": 772.88,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Pharaoh's body. Have you seen his body in the...? Did you go to mummies' room at the museum?",
      "start": 772.88,
      "end": 776.905,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I (unintelligible)",
      "start": 776.905,
      "end": 778.598,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Did you see that? Ismail Barakat: Bloody awful.",
      "start": 778.598,
      "end": 779.676,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Bloody awful? Why?",
      "start": 780.0,
      "end": 783.536,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "It is, it's awful",
      "start": 783.536,
      "end": 785.33,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "I'd much rather disappear than look like that.",
      "start": 785.33,
      "end": 788.172,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, I see, yeah, but I mean the room itself, it's, it's, you enjoyed visiting it or were you...?",
      "start": 788.172,
      "end": 793.394,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Wallahi, there is, there is a...",
      "start": 793.763,
      "end": 795.0,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "freaked out. How old were you?",
      "start": 795.0,
      "end": 797.184,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "No, I, I took Polaroid of it.",
      "start": 797.184,
      "end": 799.184,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, oh, that's it. I bet you enjoyed it.",
      "start": 799.184,
      "end": 801.491,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, you know, partly because there is an, an aura of death and despair and, and, and, and what's the word I'm looking for.",
      "start": 802.249,
      "end": 809.318,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Awe.",
      "start": 809.318,
      "end": 810.0,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "in, in the, in that room.",
      "start": 810.0,
      "end": 811.53,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "It's, you're, you're happy to be out of it.",
      "start": 811.53,
      "end": 814.284,
      "speaker": "Isamil Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "If you are to ask, we enjoyed it. Because Stephanie loved it.",
      "start": 815.021,
      "end": 818.557,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "No, no.",
      "start": 819.26,
      "end": 820.604,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Sammy got a kick out of it.",
      "start": 820.604,
      "end": 821.867,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I would imagine Sammy would.",
      "start": 822.85,
      "end": 824.604,
      "speaker": "Isamil Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "How did it look like? How did the body look like?",
      "start": 824.604,
      "end": 826.604,
      "speaker": "Behrouz",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Dried up, dried up bodies.",
      "start": 827.3,
      "end": 829.962,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "They uncovered the faces of some of them. You can see the teeth and the hair.",
      "start": 830.269,
      "end": 834.354,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Really?",
      "start": 834.354,
      "end": 835.31,
      "speaker": "A woman",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes. They just dried up, slightly freeze dried human human blood.",
      "start": 835.31,
      "end": 839.583,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yep.",
      "start": 839.583,
      "end": 840.505,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "And with the skin and everything?",
      "start": 840.505,
      "end": 841.583,
