    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "start": 886.263,
      "end": 886.763,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Is it, you know, they, they, when they, when they took him there, they, when he arrived, they fired the 21-gun salute.",
