      "end": 905.086,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Wow.",
      "start": 905.086,
      "end": 905.796,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "He was a very important king.",
      "start": 907.174,
      "end": 908.979,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "He was a king. That's right. Dr. Khalifa: Yeah.",
      "start": 909.839,
      "end": 912.146,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "He was rotting. He was sick.",
      "start": 913.252,
      "end": 914.945,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Did you hear the joke about this statue getting tired because it is standing up?",
      "start": 915.0,
      "end": 919.206,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Standing up for what? 4000 years? There must be something going on. Dr. Khalifa: Yes.",
      "start": 919.575,
      "end": 922.892,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "No, but in, in Cairo standing up in",
      "start": 922.892,
      "end": 926.032,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "in the middle of the",
      "start": 926.401,
      "end": 927.479,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "railway station.",
      "start": 927.7860000000001,
      "end": 929.54,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, and he's peeing on the people.",
      "start": 929.54,
      "end": 930.947,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "This is what Sammy used to say. Because there's a fountain of water coming under him.",
      "start": 930.947,
      "end": 935.191,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "This is why Ismail Barakat: That's what they (unintelligible)",
      "start": 935.191,
      "end": 937.191,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Sammy was only 3 years old. He said \"Ramses is going wee wee.\"",
      "start": 937.218,
      "end": 940.752,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "And on all these people.",
      "start": 941.981,
      "end": 943.367,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Huh?",
      "start": 944.104,
      "end": 945.0,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "And on these people.",
      "start": 945.0,
      "end": 946.159,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Right. Every time, he never failed every time we passed by it,",
      "start": 946.65,
      "end": 950.721,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "he says \"Ramses is going wee wee.\" Yeah,  this is what he used to say when going to the bathroom. (unintelligible)",
      "start": 950.721,
      "end": 956.345,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "\"I wanna go wee wee.\" But, you know, \"Ramses is going wee wee.\"",
      "start": 957.602,
      "end": 960.294,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "What's, what's...",
      "start": 960.601,
      "end": 961.679,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "So, the joke is that he, he told the prime minister",
      "start": 961.679,
      "end": 965.7,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "\"I'm getting tired of this (unintelligible) sitting down and stuff, camels and a horse, this and that",
      "start": 965.7,
      "end": 970.74,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "\"from standing up, I'm getting tired. So, get me a horse or something.\" So, the prime minister thought",
      "start": 970.74,
      "end": 976.56,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "it was a very serious matter. So, he went and talked to the  president, Mubarak. And then Mubarak said",
      "start": 976.56,
      "end": 981.797,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "\"well, let's answer to him personally.\" So, here comes the prime minister with Hosni Mubarak (unintelligible)",
      "start": 981.797,
      "end": 986.077,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "\"I said a horse, not a bald donkey.\"",
      "start": 986.077,
      "end": 988.277,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "\"coming back with a donkey.\"",
      "start": 997.738,
      "end": 999.165,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "In Arabic, it's much funnier.",
      "start": 1003.711,
      "end": 1005.26,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "No, it's equally funny.",
