      "end": 1006.5840000000001,
      "speaker": "Ismail Barakat",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "In English, too.",
      "start": 1008.5840000000001,
      "end": 1009.785,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "So, they, before we close here because we have to let the people who work go to work.",
