      "end": 1038.414,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "*10:92 God endowed the Egyptians with the exclusive knowledge of mummification. Today, Pharaoh's mummified body is on display at the Cairo Museum.",
      "start": 1038.414,
      "end": 1047.863,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "This is really profound because they, I mean, only in that era, that period of time that they were mummifying",
