      "end": 1120.932,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Sure I'm slow, but you should have some patience.\"",
      "start": 1120.932,
      "end": 1123.492,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": []
    },
    {
